<title>SWITZERLAND: Swiss blue-chip SMI hits record high.</title>
<headline>Swiss blue-chip SMI hits record high.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Switzerland's blue-chip Swiss Market Index hit a record high, breaking above the previous peak of 3838.7 points set on October 15.</p>
<p>The index was quoted at 3,841.8, up 14.2 points, at 1348 GMT.</p>
<p>Traders cited yesterday's gains on Wall Street, rising bond futures, and stepped-up purchases by foreign investors for the gain.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
